# Pitch TUNE: held in tune by ear (the test's player) the duel goes on; let go, it drifts out and ends
wait 800
turn SELECT 12
wait 400
tap PLAY
wait 100
turn K1 1
wait 50
shot stand.png
tap PLAY
autotune on
wait 15000
expect pitch_state 1
expect pitch_err >-3
expect pitch_err <3
shot tuning.png
autotune off
wait 60000
expect pitch_state 3
shot over.png
